":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"TLZ3-eDPLhUzfsWO4ad6Ug","review_id":"i-eDebP5Bsq5RY5dC5zGow","date":"2019-11-05T17:14:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9396529197692871,"text_excerpt":"Fantastic food and service. It was a nice bar with a great menu that included shrimp po boys and fries loaded with roast beef and cheese. The fries were great. Could have been a meal by itself. Poboys were delicious. Service was great and friendly. A mist stop if you are in the area"},{"business_id":"TLZ3-eDPLhUzfsWO4ad6Ug","review_id":"wHmdmKEeu-YQjMyk_vimMQ","date":"2018-10-07T22:21:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.937263011932373,"text_excerpt":"Shrimp po-boys are one of my must have meals when in New Orleans. If heard some good things about Mahoney's and their location in the Quarter made them an easy choice for a weekday lunch. I decided on their onion rings (more like straws) and a Coke to complete the meal. Mahoney's does a light, crisp batter on their plentiful portion of shrimp. Gorgeous tomatoes and fresh lettuce were an excellent addition to the sandwich. I love pickles on my Po-boys as they bring a terrific crunch and acidity. The local bread was crunchy perfection but cut a bit oversized. If they created a trough in the bread, it would have made life a tad easier keeping the fillings inside. I was very happy with my po-..."},{"business_id":"TLZ3-eDPLhUzfsWO4ad6Ug","review_id":"0eOT4ZnYdedsJp4oV-iXUQ","date":"2018-12-04T00:27:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9360896944999695,"text_excerpt":"On my Sunday po-boy adventures we decided to stop into Mahony's in the French Quarters. I've been to the Magazine location several times and they never disappoint but different locations have different cooks so there we were. The location isn't very convenient if you're traveling by car and need to park but for tourist in the area it's perfect, we lucked up and found a spot just a few feet from the door. We ordered the fried crawfish almondine and it was soooo delicious and perfect for sharing. We also ordered the shrimp po-boy (duh) and a hamburger po-boy. The shrimp of course was good but the bread was a bit stale (hard) for my taste on both sandwiches. The waitress told us that was not..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"TLZ3-eDPLhUzfsWO4ad6Ug","photo_id":"FU2PSgotWlIkYlSGK995VQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/FU2PSgotWlIkYlSGK995VQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8822796940803528},{"business_id":"TLZ3-eDPLhUzfsWO4ad6Ug","photo_id":"LBWDgMYjclMYu9wpStbChg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LBWDgMYjclMYu9wpStbChg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8591545224189758},{"business_id":"TLZ3-eDPLhUzfsWO4ad6Ug","photo_id":"bhBoa4FZMz6tMRItfjSZig","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/bhBoa4FZMz6tMRItfjSZig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.845260500907898},{"business_id":"TLZ3-eDPLhUzfsWO4ad6Ug","photo_id":"pFYyj8i88Szagu3iHetlPA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pFYyj8i88Szagu3iHetlPA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8270177841186523},{"business_id":"TLZ3-eDPLhUzfsWO4ad6Ug","photo_id":"hxKYYDY7nA7Q7eA7ePf7tw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hxKYYDY7nA7Q7eA7ePf7tw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8037798404693604}]},"notebook_case":null}
